---
workspace_name: "ZWave_SoC_MultilevelSensor_Solution"
label: "ZWave_SoC_MultilevelSensor_Solution"
quality: "production"
description: "Demonstrates Switch Multilevel Sensor application combined with OTA\
  \ bootloader.  The Z-Wave Switch Multilevel Sensor application shows the ability\
  \ to advertize  numerical sensor readings, such as temperature and humidity, and\
  \ so on.  Multiple parameters can be set for the minimum and maximum values, and\
  \ a  notification will be sent if the measured temperature value is out of the range.\n"
project:
- id: "application"
  path: "zwave_soc_multilevel_sensor.slcp"
  output: "."
- id: "bootloader"
  path: "..\\bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_2\\bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_2.slcp"
  output: "../bootloader-storage-internal-single-zwave-ota_2"
post_build:
  profile: "zwave_workspace"
  path: "ZWave_SoC_MultilevelSensor_Solution.slpb"
